## Absolute rules — never break these
- NEVER edit WRTeam core files. Plugin/module only.
- NEVER make destructive DB changes. Additive migrations only.
- NEVER hardcode Barmer or any city. Use dynamic city resolution.
- NEVER write SQL directly. Use Eloquent or Query Builder.
- NEVER use max(id)+1 for sequence generation. Use the rental_agreement_sequences table with lockForUpdate().
- NEVER expose private files via public URLs. All downloads go through a signed controller.
- NEVER put gold (#B89A4A) on buttons, nav, or focus rings. Gold is accent only.
- NEVER skip audit logging on status changes, downloads, or uploads.
- NEVER auto-complete an agreement when a signed copy is uploaded. Admin must mark completed.

## Plugin structure (follow TrustVerification as the pattern)
- Laravel plugin path:  app/Plugins/{PluginName}/
- Namespace:            App\Plugins\{PluginName}\
- Sub-folders:          Contracts/ Controllers/ Models/ Providers/ Services/
- Migrations path:      app/Plugins/{PluginName}/database/migrations/
- Views path:           app/Plugins/{PluginName}/views/
- View namespace:       '{plugin-name}::admin.index'
- Routes registered in: RentalAgreementServiceProvider::boot()
- Provider registered in: config/app.php providers array

