## Signed copy upload rules
- Admin: can upload for any agreement
- Customer: can upload only their own agreement (check customer_id)
- One active copy at a time (new upload overwrites signed_pdf_path)
- Audit log must record every upload including replacements
- Allowed types: PDF, JPG, PNG | Max size: 10MB
- Upload does NOT auto-complete the agreement

## Audit actions (exhaustive v1 list — no others)
agreement_created | agreement_updated | agreement_pdf_generated
agreement_downloaded | agreement_signed_copy_uploaded
agreement_status_changed | agreement_cancelled

## Agreement numbering
- Format: RA-{YEAR}-{000001}
- Table:  rental_agreement_sequences
- Method: DB::transaction with lockForUpdate() on the sequence row
- Never use: max(id)+1, Redis, cache, UUID for this

